(defmodule decorations
  "**What is drawn over the text but is not the text** — the change bars beside a line edited
since the last commit (diff-hl), the fill-column rule, invisible characters made visible, a
jump's flash (pulsar), brackets coloured by depth, the bracket pair at point, misspelled words
(jinx), whitespace shown.

The context's details live under `src/decorations/`, one decoration each. None is called from
outside: each registers what it paints at load — a highlight source, an override source, an
idle job, a row of the gutter (`model/register-highlight-source` and its siblings) — and the
view paints what is registered. A decoration that has not loaded paints nothing, so loading
this module loads them all."
  (:use decorations/diffhl :only []) ; the change bars: a line's status, worked out off the loop
  (:use decorations/fillindicator :only []) ; the fill-column rule
  (:use decorations/glyphless :only []) ; invisible characters as escapes, no-break spaces
  (:use decorations/pulse :only []) ; a flash on the line after a jump
  (:use decorations/rainbow :only []) ; brackets coloured by depth
  (:use decorations/showparen :only []) ; the bracket pair at point
  (:use decorations/spell :only []) ; the idle-beat spell check, M-$ / C-M-$
  (:use decorations/whitespace :only [])) ; whitespace shown
